/* 大世界街巷事件库 卷4 / 校园·神殿·酒馆·孤儿院日常与NPC偶遇 / 零编号命名 */
:: MP World Library TopBeamBookmarkTin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
学校图书馆古籍区最顶层的木架横梁上放着一只落灰的锡制书签盒。<<mpAmbient>>你停下脚步打量四周，发现锡制书签盒边缘还留着前人封存时的暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收起随身工具退回前段 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-library-topbeambookmarktin">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开遮挡细看锡制书签盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-library-topbeambookmarktin">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_library_topbeambookmarktin")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你顺着学校图书的掩护打开制书签盒，将里面的旧银币与未鉴定古物收入怀中。<span class="green">你在学校图书顺遂起出了制书签盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[整理行装原路返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	制书签盒卡得颇紧，你伸手拨弄时指节在学校图书边缘擦出了一道红印。<span class="red">指节被制书签盒边角刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[缓口气重新尝试 (0:04)|MP World Library TopBeamBookmarkTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖退回安全处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看清石缝走向慢慢抽起 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-library-topbeambookmarktin">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_library_topbeambookmarktin")>><<money 220>><</if>>
	你稳住手腕卸开卡扣，将锡制书签盒连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的锡制书签盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着石阶退回入口处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	街口忽然传来路人交谈声，你动作一滞，袖口蹭上了一点浮灰。<span class="red">为免引人注意，你先停手退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[等路人走远再试 (0:04)|MP World Library TopBeamBookmarkTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回外围通道歇脚 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

